menu "Providers (sys_data_provider)"

    config SYS_DATA_PROVIDER_MAX
        int "Maximum providers registered on the board"
        default 8
        range 1 32
        help
            Fixed table of provider slots; static and CREATEd providers share it.

    config SYS_DATA_PROVIDER_SIZE
        int "Largest driver struct of a provider, in bytes"
        default 64
        range 16 1024
        help
            Every provider slot holds its driver's struct (sys_data_provider_t first), never freed:
            SYS_DATA_PROVIDER_MAX slots of this size. A larger driver struct fails to build.

    config SYS_DATA_PROVIDER_TYPES
        int "Maximum provider driver types"
        default 8
        range 1 32
        help
            Self-registered provider driver types (SYS_DATA_PROVIDER_TYPE_DEFINE).

endmenu
